# R-13: no unwrap, expect, crash macro or assert inside a macro definition.

case: unwrap-in-macro
tool: ast-grep
expect: no-panic-in-macro-body
--- module
macro_rules! planted {
    ($v:expr) => {
        $v.unwrap()
    };
}

case: assert-in-macro
tool: ast-grep
expect: no-panic-in-macro-body
--- module
macro_rules! planted {
    ($v:expr) => {
        assert!($v)
    };
}
